Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.00,H_ms,,0,0,0,,"Lontar GUNUNG pun dikira strategi?!"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.00,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.70,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Strategi saya berjaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Betul-betul strategi hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak pakai kuasa kasar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.90,S_ms,,0,0,0,,angkat gunung hancurkan orang panggil strategi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Apa kaitannya dengan strategi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:10.76,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tarik diri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:11.76,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ganjaran dihantar:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.44,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan +1, tuan rumah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:15.54,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sistem jahat, tak sudah-sudah lagi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.58,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak sistem ahli strategi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.58,S_ms,,0,0,0,,atau sistem otot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.92,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tambah kebijaksanaan lah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana, Tuan Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Lapor, Tuanku:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:23.24,S_ms,,0,0,0,,misi berjaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.64,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Strategi saya berjaya lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.58,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.56,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tahniah atas jasa besar, Tuan Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Pergi ambil ganjaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.76,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Tuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.12,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Apa yang berlaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tuan Li panjat gunung tangan kosong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,memecahkan punggung bukit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.56,S_ms,,0,0,0,,cabut gunung sepuluh zhang,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:36.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,dan hancurkan musuh beserta perisainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:38.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Itu dikira strategi berjaya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.46,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saudara Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.66,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sungguh bijak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.98,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hebat tiada terkata!
